00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.120
de rejet de responsabilité.

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.260
Il y a ensuite

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.400
la boucle de clarification infinie

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:27.660
de l'IA,

